WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.067
Today we will revise a work thoughtfully. Our work connects with selected artists and

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.109
traditions in Ghana.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:12.314
Read or listen to one helpful comment on the draft. Name a design choice that a

00:00:12.314 --> 00:00:13.990
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.789
Choose one change that supports the artwork’s purpose.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:22.088
Make the change and explain how the second version improved.
